All 48 odor-material doses other than Caraway and Benzyl Benzoate, every other prepared-stock concentration, and the sole Ethylene Brassylate musk remain identical to committed V6. The 100 uL Caraway-stock aliquot is directly measurable above the 10 uL floor. Because DEP and Benzyl Benzoate are not assumed olfactorily equivalent, V6 is not a clean one-axis Caraway control; the primary blind set below uses an exact DEP-matched V7 control. PW's supplier impact and use-range data support spending one controlled trial despite the missing OAV; they do not prove perception, realism, liking, or success.

