## Controlled blinded acceptance protocol

### Primary constant-total, DEP-matched Caraway comparison

- Compare **V7-C matched control** against **V7-T Caraway candidate** at identical 6,000 uL concentrate and 20% finished concentration. V7-T is the current table. V7-C is identical except that its 100 uL Caraway Seed Essential Oil 10% in DEP row is replaced one-for-one by 100 uL neat DEP. The physical difference is therefore 10 uL nominal active Caraway versus 10 uL additional DEP inside an otherwise exactly matched 100 uL vehicle slot.
- Do not use committed V6 as the primary Caraway control: V6 has 300 uL Benzyl Benzoate and 20 uL DPG, whereas the rebased V7 matrix has 210 uL Benzyl Benzoate, 10 uL DPG, and a 100 uL DEP/Caraway vehicle slot. A separate V6-versus-V7-C comparison may diagnose whether that vehicle/fixative rebase altered the chassis, but it cannot establish a Caraway effect.
- Prepare two independent full-concentrate master sets on different occasions. Make duplicate coded pours from each master. Use anonymous randomized codes, balanced order, equal application mass, identical substrate, and a sealed key.
- Read free description first at 0, 5, 30, and 120 minutes, then 6 and 24 hours.
- Score 0–10: LNDL recognizability; cardamom leadership; lavender continuity; cold capsule clarity; realistic aromatic-seed nuance; warm crushed-seed plausibility; shell-to-seed continuity; cardamom-to-coumarin recurrence; violet-suede tailoring; literal cedar/vetiver verticality; yielding interior; airy/dense simultaneity; tenderness under pressure; spatial depth; late identity recurrence; overall liking; luxury/style.
- Score defects separately: culinary caraway; pickle/dill effect; medicinal/herbal harshness; anise-like drift; lavender detergent; pastry/candy; lipstick iris; explicit leather; woody-amber wall; muddiness; sweetness; fatigue; intensity imbalance.

V7-T advances only if LNDL identity is at least 6/10 and no more than one point below V7-C; cardamom leadership is not lower by more than one point; overall liking is not lower; realistic aromatic-seed nuance or shell-to-seed continuity improves by at least one point; culinary-caraway, pickle/dill, medicinal, and anise-like defects remain no worse than V7-C by more than one point; and both independent master sets show the same direction. If perceived intensity differs by more than one point, intensity-match and repeat. Discordant masters are `HOLD`, not averaged into success.

This DEP-matched pair is the one-axis constant-total test of 10 uL nominal active Caraway. A null result means `NO DETECTED EFFECT AT 10 uL ACTIVE-EQUIVALENT IN THIS PROTOCOL`; it does not validate a dormant ingredient, disprove Caraway generally, or justify raising the dose blindly.

### High-value follow-up only if implicated

If V7-T shows a repeatable beneficial seed effect but culinary/pickle drift, test one new constant-total attenuation arm only: replace 50 uL of V7-T's 100 uL Caraway 10% in DEP stock with 50 uL neat DEP. The arm therefore contains 50 uL Caraway stock plus 50 uL neat DEP in the same 100 uL vehicle slot and delivers 5 uL nominal active Caraway. It remains 6,000 uL and directly tests dose attenuation. Prepare it only after physical V7 evidence; it is not part of the primary build.

A null result is `NO DETECTED EFFECT AT THIS DOSE/PROTOCOL`, not proof of universal redundancy. Ingredient count remains hidden from evaluators.

## Claim ceiling

This artifact is a target-first theory formula and controlled experimental design. It has not been physically compounded or smelled. Passing parser, donor-independence, inventory, OAV, temporal, or release checks cannot establish similarity, liking, hedonism, luxury, completion, complexity, depth, three-dimensionality, safety, stability, diffusion, longevity, maturation, or commercial release.

## Pipeline Analysis — SUPERSEDED PRE-2026-08-29 RUNTIME RESULT

This complete result is retained byte-for-byte as computational provenance. It is superseded for current repository verification because a fresh exact-byte run under the 2026-08-29 runtime produces a different confidence result and failure count. It remains `NOT TESTED` and must not be presented as release evidence.

> **Current-stock authority:** Caraway Seed Essential Oil is modeled only as 100 uL of the user-authoritative 10% in DEP stock, yielding 10 uL nominal active oil. Because whole-oil VP and ODT are missing, any formatter-rendered Caraway `OAV=0` is a missing-data artifact, not evidence of dormancy or imperceptibility. All headspace and temporal totals remain partial diagnostics that exclude a defensible Caraway contribution.

